# Agent memory

Repo files are the source of truth across models and Cloud Agents.

## Always

- Treat `memory/NOW.md` as current intent (≤ ~80 lines). Update it when the goal or next action changes.
- Put durable truths in `memory/facts.md`; put choices in `memory/decisions.md` (newest first).
- For large work, use `tasks/<slug>/state.md` and put the slug in `tasks/ACTIVE`.
- Do not rely on Cursor Memories for cross-model or Cloud Agent continuity.

## After compaction

Hooks reinject a budgeted bundle headed **Restored project memory** on the next tool call. Prefer that reinjected NOW over stale chat summary when they disagree.

## When unsure

Read `.cursor/skills/agent-memory/SKILL.md` or run `python3 scripts/memory_doctor.py`.
